// Chapter 22 (Inline Assembly): compact control-flow assembly `asm { jmp
// my_state() }` is accepted when the target resolves to an Omega state
// transition. `asm` is a statement keyword -- `parse_statement` dispatches it
// contextually -- and this fixture compiles as a pass canary.

machine main() {
    asm {
        jmp other()
    }

    machine other() {
    }
}
